Monkey's Audio SDK 13.47, MSVC: drop the GCC warning options

cl rejects -Wextra, which the SDK's CMakeLists passes to every compiler.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -12,7 +12,6 @@
 check_cxx_compiler_flag(-Wpedantic HAVE_WPEDANTIC_FLAG)
 
 # Show all the warnings (hopefully there aren't any!)
-add_compile_options(-Wall -Wextra)
 
 if(HAVE_WPEDANTIC_FLAG)
   add_compile_options(-Wpedantic)
